  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:af_orach_mishpatekha">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/26/8"/><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/1"/>Even for the ways of Your judgements, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/2"/>we hope for You.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/3"/>The greatness of Your Name and Your mention
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/4"/>is our soul’s desire.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/5"/>We hope for You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/6"/>turn to us and hear our cry.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/7"/>And now, what is our hope, Adonoy?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/8"/>Our yearning is for You[r deliverance].
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/9"/>Only for God does our soul yearn;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/10"/>from Him will come our deliverance.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/42/2"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/11"/>As the stag cries out in thirst
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/12"/>for the springs of water,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/13"/>so do our souls cry out in thirst
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/14"/>for You, O God.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/23/6"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/15"/>[May] only good and kindness pursue us
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/16"/>all the days of our lives,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/17"/>and we shall dwell in the House of Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:af_orach_mishpatekha/18"/>for long days.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
